WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:02.160
(exhales forcefully)

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.360
But it's not crocodiles

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.880
I should have been
watching out for.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.960
Instead, it's one of the most
temperamental animals out here.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
(hippo snorting)

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.400
Wow, there are a lot of eyes
looking in my direction,

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.680
a lot of ears pointed
in my direction.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.480
They know I'm here.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:32.600
Hippos kill more people
than any other large animal

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.000
in the entire world.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:38.560
Being so packed together
in such limited water,

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.000
they're stressed and ready
to defend their territory.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.600
Ooh, ooh, ooh.
Look at that one.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:47.920
It's starting to come up,
it's starting to come up.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:51.680
-(hippo bellows)
-Oh, oh, oh.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:55.640
Just showing me their jaws,
showing me their tusks

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.160
that could literally cut
a man in half.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:01.120
(hippos grunting)

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.720
They're telling me
to back off.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.080
Hippos are dangerous
in and out of the water.

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:10.120
They can run
up to 22 miles an hour.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:11.840
And in this area,

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:14.560
I need to keep a lookout
everywhere around me.

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:18.240
Oh, oh, oh, oh.
Here's what I'm talking about.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.800
The ones that are up on land,

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.680
those are just
on the land feeding,

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.680
which means there could be
more out here.

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:28.000
That's when they get
really dangerous.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:31.720
Okay, time to go.

